          <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.conditionsOfAccess.lower" xmi:uuid="a03f62d5-402f-543f-8f16-b4d5f7ecb76c">
            <value>0</value>
          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.conditionsOfAccess.upper" xmi:uuid="37e690ec-60ca-5f2f-9e3c-d994703e3ba1">
            <value>*</value>
          </upperValue>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.conditionsOfAccess.comment" xmi:uuid="7964bd54-0e5c-5418-9fb3-ea0e2588b552">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

text statement of conditions for use and access; if an online resource documents the restrictions or a URI is used to identify the conditions, recommend using schema:CreativeWork to provide a label (name) and an identifier (URI or URL). 
:minItems: 0
:idRefDescription: "a reference to a resource defining conditions of Access"
:orReference: ["string", "idReference", "value"]</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.conditionsOfAccess"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.license" xmi:uuid="fdb39f3b-7f4c-5114-9070-cb85e68bddd8">
          <name>license</name>
          <type href="../../../schemaorgProperties/labeledLink/labeledLink.xmi#cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.labeledLink.LabeledLink"/>
          <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.license.lower" xmi:uuid="afecf43d-3327-5137-ab68-f8076e9a70e2">
            <value>0</value>
          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.license.upper" xmi:uuid="1a0b8eee-8cff-530b-b53a-98b67073498d">
            <value>*</value>
          </upperValue>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.license.comment" xmi:uuid="d61ed1ae-e1ab-5f50-8f0a-8e68afe2984a">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

legal statement of conditions for use and access; recommend using schema:CreativeWork to provide a label (name) for the license, and an identifier. Sources of license identifiers: https://opensource.org/licenses/, https://creativecommons.org/about/cclicenses/, https://spdx.org/licenses/, http://cor.esipfed.org/ont/earthcube/swl. If only a string is provided, it should be an identifier for the license, ideally a resolvable URI
:minItems: 0
:idRefDescription: "a reference to a license defintion"
:orReference: ["string", "idReference", "value"]</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.license"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.url" xmi:uuid="50986f70-d9c1-5019-be91-20434a856853">
          <name>url</name>
          <type href="../../../cdifCommonTypes.xmi#XMLSchemaDataTypes.XsdAnyUri"/>
          <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.url.lower" xmi:uuid="125a98d2-f476-56e0-8445-e7153f5f079f">
            <value>0</value>
          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.url.upper" xmi:uuid="2511781c-3a38-5b5b-93c2-150da5d2cd68">
            <value>1</value>
          </upperValue>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.url.comment" xmi:uuid="fea6636c-d080-5096-af2d-da103a21ef2a">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Web Location of a page describing the dataset (landing page), typically providing links or instructions to get the actual resource content; analogous to dcat:accessURL. If a direct link is available to get the data, put in distribution/contentUrl</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.url"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.distribution" xmi:uuid="34101088-6a77-5e69-a1c2-b680fbe1e337">
          <name>distribution</name>
          <type xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.DataDownloadOrWebAPI"/>
          <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.distribution.lower" xmi:uuid="fbd35a2f-24cb-5b44-b29c-484e7bc3c0b0">
            <value>0</value>
          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.distribution.upper" xmi:uuid="1a587662-2bf2-5054-837f-6fde036e03e4">
            <value>*</value>
          </upperValue>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifCore.Core.distribution.comment" xmi:uuid="49a761c3-d7d1-5fa7-b5ff-91ad1742ac37">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

specifies how to download the data in a specific format or access via a web API. This property describes where to get the data and in what format by using the schema:DataDownload type. If user must access data through a landing page, provide link to landing page in the 'url' property for the dataset</body>
