            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Keywords are an array of strings, an array of schema:DefinedTerms, or some combination of these. If you have information about a controlled vocabulary from which keywords come from, use schema:DefinedTerm to descibe that keyword. This allowed variability makes parsing metadata hard; recommend using DefinedTerm for all keywords if any of them are from a known vocabulary, otherwise an array of strings.</body>
